interpretation:
  anon_executable ↑  → published AOT code (r-xp anonymous mmap)
  anon_rw_large ↑    → bulk anonymous mmap (CodeMemory compile buffers / linear mem)
  anon_rw_small ↑    → small anonymous rw mappings (stacks, arenas)
  libwasmer_exec   → DSO text (usually stable); growth may mean remapping
  lazyFree > 0     → madvise(MADV_FREE) pending kernel reclaim
